t":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0585,"r5":-0.03,"r20":-0.0835,"r1_spy":-0.0501,"r5_spy":-0.0261,"r20_spy":-0.0751}}],"quotes":[{"c":"NTES 2018 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2018-11-14","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"We believe China's digital online music market has tremendous potential for continued growth, as younger generations embrace the convenience of streaming music services and online music becomes a way of lifestyle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/15/netease-inc-ntes-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2018 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2018-11-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"At the very China International Import Expo that took place in Shanghai last week, the government shared its intention to encourage import's trade increase consumer confidence, reduce tariff and promote cross border e-commerce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/15/netease-inc-ntes-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2018 Q4","e":"ntes","d":"2019-02-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"The main components within this segment have not dramatically changed and as a reminder, include live video streaming, Cloud Music, online education and certain other cloud application services among others.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/netease-ntes-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2018 Q4","e":"ntes","d":"2019-02-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"NetEase, given our scale and track record in operating online games, we have a diversified source of new user acquisitions, among which short video live streaming is becoming an increasingly important source of new user acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/netease-ntes-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2019 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2019-08-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Zhaoxuan Yang","x":"Net revenues from our innovative businesses and others were RMB1.5 billion up 18% quarter-over-quarter and 23% year-over-year, both due to increased contribution from Cloud Music, CC live streaming and Youdao.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/netease-inc-ntes-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2019 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2019-08-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Ding","x":"The third is broadcasting, which is not only in the format of video live streaming, but also audio broadcasting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/netease-inc-ntes-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2019 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2019-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Charles Zhaoxuan Yang","x":"So a lot of market rumors commenting on massive layoffs and all that, those are actually just not fact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/netease-inc-ntes-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2019 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2019-11-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Zhaoxuan Yang","x":"Revenue growth has been strong across the board in subscription, advertising and live streaming, leading to continued improvement in our financials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/21/netease-inc-ntes-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2019 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2019-11-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Ding","x":"…he thinks that the short video industry in general is actually a positive catalyst to China's online music industry because as you can see, all the presentation of short format video, as well as live streaming require some sort of a music element, which actually helps to promote music popularity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/21/netease-inc-ntes-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2019 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2019-11-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Charles Zhaoxuan Yang","x":"I think this is a strong factual evidence dismiss many ungrounded market rumors of so-called massive layoffs about NetEase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/21/netease-inc-ntes-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2019 Q4","e":"ntes","d":"2020-02-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Zhaoxuan Yang","x":"Revenues from digital albums and live streaming also grew rapidly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/netease-inc-ntes-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2019 Q4","e":"ntes","d":"2020-02-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Zhaoxuan Yang","x":"In the fourth quarter, it was up 18% year-over-year to reach CNY3.7 billion, mainly due to the increased revenue contribution from Cloud Music and CC live streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/netease-inc-ntes-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q1","e":"ntes","d":"2020-05-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Zhaoxuan Yang","x":"Live streaming revenue is also growing at a rapid pace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/20/netease-inc-ntes-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q1","e":"ntes","d":"2020-05-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Zhaoxuan Yang","x":"These include the Bedroom Live Music Festival [Indecipherable] where well known musicians performed at home via live streaming and Indie Live, a high quality broadcast of independent brands -- bands' live shows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/20/netease-inc-ntes-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2020-08-13","l":"cinema","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"If you look at today, the cost of a movie ticket in China is already comparable to a movie -- a cinema movie ticket spending in the States.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/netease-ntes-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2020-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"For NetEase Cloud Music, we continued to see triple-digit revenue growth in the second quarter year over year, with both membership and live streaming striking new highs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/netease-ntes-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2020-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"We also entered in new partnerships with top live streamers and KOLs which led to a rapid growth in sales through live streaming platforms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/13/netease-ntes-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2020-11-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"And over the last seven years, as we all can see, the consumer habit has dramatically changed to using streaming consumption rather than buying a CD or downloading mp3.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/19/netease-ntes-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2020-11-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"Live streaming is a very fast-growing monetization vertical for NetEase Cloud Music, well, partly also because we also grow from a relatively much smaller base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/19/netease-ntes-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q4","e":"ntes","d":"2021-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"As one of China's most influential music streaming platforms for original music, we continue to empower independent musicians, giving them the tools and audience to help them create more hit songs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/netease-ntes-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2020 Q4","e":"ntes","d":"2021-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"This is mainly due to the increased contribution from NetEase Cloud Music, NetEase PC live streaming and Yanxuan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/netease-ntes-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2021 Q1","e":"ntes","d":"2021-05-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"Net revenues from innovative businesses and others were RMB4.2 billion for the first quarter, up 40% year over year, mainly due to increased contribution from NetEase cloud music, as well as Yanxuan and CC live streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/18/netease-ntes-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2021 Q1","e":"ntes","d":"2021-05-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"And we are very encouraged to see strong continued and robust growth in both subscription, live streaming, advertising, and new possibilities as we continue to innovate and try out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/18/netease-ntes-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2021 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2021-08-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"For Cloud Music, both membership and the streaming revenues maintained solid growth momentum driven by robust paying user expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/31/netease-ntes-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2021 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2021-08-31","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Thomas Chong","x":"Given the government is having stringent measures about the fandom culture in China and more regulations on the live streaming these days, just want to get a sense about -- how the fandom culture will affect our music business and also our live-streaming outlook?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/31/netease-ntes-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2021 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2021-11-16","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"For cloud music, both membership and live streaming revenues maintained solid growth momentum driven by robust paying user expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/16/netease-ntes-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2021 Q3","e":"ntes","d":"2021-11-16","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"The decrease was mainly due to decreased gross profit margin from the games streaming business in CC live streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/16/netease-ntes-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2021 Q4","e":"ntes","d":"2022-02-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"Both increases were primarily due to increased revenues from social entertainment services, particularly audio-based, live streaming, and paid user expansions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/24/netease-ntes-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2022 Q1","e":"ntes","d":"2022-05-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"Featuring unchained melee combat, Naraka: Bladepoint was a huge breakthrough for us in eSports and has become one of the most popular games on live streaming platforms in China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/24/netease-ntes-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTES 2022 Q2","e":"ntes","d":"2022-08-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Yang","x":"…provide a range of tools and services to our users to enhance their overall gaming experience when they play our games such as the CC live streaming service a platform offering various live streaming content with a primary focus on gaming broadcasting and certain game-related merchandise sales.","url":"https://www.fool.c